{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p>### 14-1. Āsavaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-40-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-40a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-40b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19122.668122795912\">5:18:42</span> 1. Noāsavaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noāsavo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40b-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19131.851625887466\">5:18:51</span> 2. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… kamme ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40b-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19138.268437837876\">5:18:58</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-40c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19144.574005169277\">5:19:04</span> 3. Āsavaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40c-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19151.623072985694\">5:19:11</span> 4. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40c-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19156.56917682357\">5:19:16</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19166.341801035764\">5:19:26</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi sabbattha vitthāretabbo.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19173.248293050066\">5:19:33</span> 5. Āsavo akusalo dhammo āsavassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. ^7-40c-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19181.367156929427\">5:19:41</span> 6. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava (majjhe tiṇṇaṃ sahajātādhipati labbhati), anantare nava…pe… upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi…pe… jhāne tīṇi, magge nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40c-6</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-40d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19202.683012\">5:20:02</span> 7. Noāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40d-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19207.94530820342\">5:20:07</span> 8. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi paccayavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) ^7-40d-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19217.339803881554\">5:20:17</span> Āsavadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 15-1. Sāsavaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-40e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-40f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19220.71199218797\">5:20:20</span> 9. Sāsavaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-40f-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19227.567454198266\">5:20:27</span> Anāsavaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anāsavo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19234.886687951075\">5:20:34</span> 10. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomaṃ). ^7-40f-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19240.822386788856\">5:20:40</span> 11. Naadhipatiyā dve…pe… naāsevane ekaṃ…pe… navippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Paccanīyaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi sabbattha dve). ^7-40f-11</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-40g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19249.810754783706\">5:20:49</span> 12. Sāsavo kusalo dhammo sāsavassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-40g-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19256.83238100515\">5:20:56</span> Anāsavo kusalo dhammo anāsavassa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19263.914961090122\">5:21:03</span> 13. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare dve…pe… nissaye dve, upanissaye cattāri, āsevane dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40g-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19272.701860095272\">5:21:12</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-40h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19286.72515607982\">5:21:26</span> 14. Sāsavaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40h-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19297.189970113297\">5:21:37</span> 15. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40h-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19302.376298703886\">5:21:42</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-40i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19307.911045082397\">5:21:47</span> 16. Sāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-40i-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19315.368261961376\">5:21:55</span> Anāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Anāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Anāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo abyākato ca anāsavo abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19333.719357226593\">5:22:13</span> Sāsavaṃ abyākatañca anāsavaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19344.979284956225\">5:22:24</span> 17. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… āsevane ekaṃ…pe… vipāke pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40i-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19353.11056495365\">5:22:33</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā dve, napurejāte cattāri, napacchājāte naāsevane pañca, nakamme…pe… namagge ekaṃ…pe… navippayutte dve…pe… novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi sabbattha vitthāretabbo.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-40j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19368.633832254916\">5:22:48</span> 18. Sāsavo abyākato dhammo sāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-40j-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19376.239886961375\">5:22:56</span> Anāsavo abyākato dhammo anāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19383.948486783705\">5:23:03</span> 19. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā anantare samanantare cattāri, sahajāte pañca, aññamaññe dve, nissaye satta, upanissaye cattāri, purejāte pacchājāte dve, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme…pe… magge cattāri, sampayutte dve, vippayutte tīṇi…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40j-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19389.255573278093\">5:23:09</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Sāsavadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 16-1. Āsavasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-40k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-40l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-40m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19404.349895866104\">5:23:24</span> 20. Āsavavippayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40m-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19413.7158710206\">5:23:33</span> 21. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-40m-21</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-40n-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19437.356546211144\">5:23:57</span> 22. Āsavasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-40n-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19447.36621916737\">5:24:07</span> Āsavavippayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>Āsavasampayuttaṃ akusalañca āsavavippayuttaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19455.500859092695\">5:24:15</span> 23. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi sabbattha pañca.) ^7-40n-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19466.0015780412\">5:24:26</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā pañca, napurejāte pañca…pe… nakamme tīṇi, navipāke pañca, navippayutte pañca (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19477.913176139045\">5:24:37</span> 24. Āsavasampayutto akusalo dhammo āsavasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-40n-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19487.423996005153\">5:24:47</span> Āsavavippayutto akusalo dhammo āsavasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>Āsavasampayutto akusalo ca āsavavippayutto akusalo ca dhammā āsavasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19496.35476014162\">5:24:56</span> 25. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā ekaṃ, anantare samanantare nava, sahajāte aññamaññe nissaye pañca, upanissaye āsevane nava, kamme āhāre indriye jhāne magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40n-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19501.41936986868\">5:25:01</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-40o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19514.82727088413\">5:25:14</span> 26. Āsavavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40o-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19528.141709064374\">5:25:28</span> 27. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40o-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19533.06734081203\">5:25:33</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… novigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi sabbattha ekaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19544.88499304635\">5:25:44</span> 28. Āsavavippayutto abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40o-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19557.201677066947\">5:25:57</span> 29. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40o-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19562.336818956224\">5:26:02</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Āsavasampayuttadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 17-1. Āsavasāsavaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-40p-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-40q-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-40r-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19573.680680283243\">5:26:13</span> 30. Sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40r-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19584.58183899485\">5:26:24</span> 31. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40r-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19589.71247227809\">5:26:29</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-40s-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19594.816547056646\">5:26:34</span> 32. Āsavañceva sāsavañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva sāsavo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-40s-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19605.97105526779\">5:26:45</span> Sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19618.482937054072\">5:26:58</span> Āsavañceva sāsavañca akusalañca sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva sāsavo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19632.910172072097\">5:27:12</span> 33. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40s-33</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19637.914929023176\">5:27:17</span> 34. Sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva sāsavo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40s-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19648.989931835207\">5:27:28</span> 35. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40s-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19665.355023113294\">5:27:45</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-40t-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19676.0676739691\">5:27:56</span> 36. Āsavo ceva sāsavoca akusalo dhammo āsavassa ceva sāsavassa ca akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40t-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19689.6218820515\">5:28:09</span> 37. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… upanissaye āsevane nava, kamme āhāre indriye jhāne tīṇi, magge sampayutte nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40t-37</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19695.3834029073\">5:28:15</span> 38. Āsavo ceva sāsavo ca akusalo dhammo āsavassa ceva sāsavassa ca akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40t-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19710.120132951077\">5:28:30</span> 39. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40t-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19714.452350848078\">5:28:34</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19718.04878315192\">5:28:38</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19721.554265737355\">5:28:41</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19734.70508214677\">5:28:54</span> 40. Sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40t-40</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19749.72286812617\">5:29:09</span> 41. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40t-41</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19754.917315734783\">5:29:14</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19759.601382927904\">5:29:19</span> Āsavasāsavadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 18-1. Āsavaāsavasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-40u-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-40v-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Akusalapadaṃ ^7-40w-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19764.434386185392\">5:29:24</span> 42. Āsavañceva āsavasampayuttañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva āsavasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-40w-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19777.335897133893\">5:29:37</span> Āsavasampayuttañceva no ca āsavaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavasampayutto ceva no ca āsavo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19790.86662097425\">5:29:50</span> Āsavañceva āsavasampayuttañca akusalañca āsavasampayuttañceva no ca āsavaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva āsavasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19808.468530830054\">5:30:08</span> 43. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40w-43</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19813.009453164796\">5:30:13</span> 44. Āsavañceva āsavasampayuttañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva āsavasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā. ^7-40w-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19825.630989773406\">5:30:25</span> 45. Naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40w-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19839.073353981978\">5:30:39</span> (Sahajātavārepi… sampayuttavārepi sabbattha nava.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-40x-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19844.99470096395\">5:30:44</span> 46. Āsavo ceva āsavasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo āsavassa ceva āsavasampayuttassa ca akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40x-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19860.364813118445\">5:31:00</span> 47. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40x-47</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19866.684075195695\">5:31:06</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19870.657234010298\">5:31:10</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19874.68272922402\">5:31:14</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19877.849386878977\">5:31:17</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Āsavaāsavasampayuttadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 19-1. Āsavavippayuttasāsavaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-40y-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Kusalapadaṃ ^7-40z-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19891.229764987125\">5:31:31</span> 48. Āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto sāsavo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Āsavavippayuttaṃ anāsavaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto anāsavo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (2) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-40z-48</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19915.254990961377\">5:31:55</span> 49. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40z-49</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19919.479190242044\">5:31:59</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbo.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-40{-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19925.424665221442\">5:32:05</span> 50. Āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-40{-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19939.381610038625\">5:32:19</span> Āsavavippayuttaṃ anāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto anāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Āsavavippayuttaṃ anāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Āsavavippayuttaṃ anāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato ca āsavavippayutto anāsavo abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19979.99661307982\">5:32:59</span> Āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavaṃ abyākatañca āsavavippayuttaṃ anāsavaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19995.925672927904\">5:33:15</span> 51. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… āsevane ekaṃ, kamme pañca, vipāke pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40{-51</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20008.96266714162\">5:33:28</span> 52. Āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40{-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20021.32247119827\">5:33:41</span> 53. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā dve …pe… napurejāte cattāri, napacchājāte naāsevane pañca, nakamme navipāke…pe… namagge ekaṃ…pe… navippayutte dve…pe… novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40{-53</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20028.86979986353\">5:33:48</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-40|-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20041.515431997424\">5:34:01</span> 54. Āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. ^7-40|-54</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20055.841555922754\">5:34:15</span> Āsavavippayutto anāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Āsavavippayutto anāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Āsavavippayutto anāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa abyākatassa ca āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa abyākatassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20094.636637097847\">5:34:54</span> Āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20106.59728398455\">5:35:06</span> Āsavavippayutto anāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Āsavavippayutto anāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20118.183882028323\">5:35:18</span> 55. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare cattāri, samanantare cattāri, sahajāte pañca, aññamaññe dve, nissaye satta, upanissaye cattāri, purejāte dve, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme cattāri, vipāke cattāri, āhāre cattāri…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40|-55</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20143.68008927294\">5:35:43</span> 56. Āsavavippayutto sāsavo abyākato dhammo āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo… purejātapaccayena paccayo… pacchājātapaccayena paccayo… āhārapaccayena paccayo… indriyapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40|-56</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20169.193163043772\">5:36:09</span> 57. Nahetuyā satta, naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-40|-57</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20173.992529061798\">5:36:13</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20177.79697901545\">5:36:17</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20181.397667830057\">5:36:21</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Āsavavippayuttasāsavadukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>Āsavagocchakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":20205.924132}